<div class="legal">
  <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 30 September 2026</p>
  <p class="legal-intro">This policy explains how Made Clear Studios Ltd uses personal information about people who visit our website, contact us, work with us or appear in our work. We are a company registered in England and Wales (company number 07323563) with our registered office at 62 St. Bernards Road, Oxford, OX2 6EJ, United Kingdom. We are the controller of this information, and in this policy "we" and "us" mean Made Clear Studios Ltd.</p>
  <p class="legal-intro">If you have any questions about this policy or how we use your information, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@madeclearstudios.com">hello@madeclearstudios.com</a>.</p>
  <nav class="legal-toc" aria-label="Contents">
    <h2 class="legal-toc-title">Contents</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><a href="#clause-1">1. Information we collect</a></li>
